<title>USA: Manufactured Home increases 1997 payout.</title>
<headline>Manufactured Home increases 1997 payout.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Manufactured Home Communities Inc said it established a 1997 annual dividend at $1.32 per share, or $0.33 per quarter, representing an eight percent increase over the 1996 payout.</p>
<p>The company also said its board declared the final 1996 quarterly dividend of $0.305 per share payable January 10, 1997, record December 27, 1996.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
